(MEMO OF FACTS AND GROUNDS) '
() '
(1. The Petitioner is a duly incorporated technology company engaged in the) '
(development of enterprise cloud infrastructure and security management.) '
() '
(2. The dispute between the parties is purely of a civil and commercial nature) '
(arising out of contractual interpretation of the Master Service Agreement) '
(dated 12.01.2022 entered into with the de-facto complainant.) '
() '
(3. The impugned FIR No. 402/2023 was registered maliciously at PS Cyber Cell) '
(to coerce the Petitioner into settling a disputed commercial invoice.) '
() '
(4. It is well settled by the Hon'ble Supreme Court in State of Haryana v. Bhajan Lal) '
(that criminal proceedings instituted with an ulterior motive for wreaking) '
(vengeance are liable to be quashed under writ jurisdiction.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
