(LEGAL SUBMISSIONS AND GROUNDS FOR QUASHING) '
() '
(A. NO OFFENCE UNDER SECTION 66 OF THE IT ACT:) '
(The ingredients of Section 66 are completely unfulfilled. The Petitioner had) '
(legitimate, contractually authorized root administrative access to the server) '
(environment. Access with authorization cannot constitute hacking.) '
() '
(B. INGREDIENTS OF SECTION 420 IPC ARE ABSENT:) '
(There was no fraudulent or dishonest intention at the inception of the contract.) '
(Mere inability to fulfill commercial milestones due to pandemic supply delays) '
(does not constitute the criminal offence of cheating.) '
() '
(PRAYER:) '
(In view of facts and circumstances stated hereinabove, Petitioner prays that this) '
(Hon'ble Court may be pleased to:) '
(\(a\) Issue a Writ of Certiorari quashing FIR No. 402/2023 PS Cyber Cell;) '
(\(b\) Pass an ad-interim order restraining coercive action against directors.) '
ET
endstream
